      <slug></slug>
      <title>What does the DPL do?</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>Debian</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;After being the person in the hot seat for most of a year, Steve wants to give some details about how the job works and how he thinks it should work.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This is *not* meant to be an early start to an election campaign, but instead an objective discussion of the role of the DPL within the Debian Project.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </description>
